# Set any subset of the manual camera controls. Set a field to NaN to leave it
# unchanged. analogue_gain is interpreted as a brightness ("exposure budget")
# change, so it survives the next frame-rate change (see camera_node).
float64 red_gain
float64 green_gain
float64 blue_gain
float64 colour_gain
float64 analogue_gain
float64 contrast
float64 saturation
float64 brightness
float64 sharpness
---
bool success
string message
